Package: ameliatorch
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to the Amelia Torch Development Prototype
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Sheng", "Wan", email = "swan0624@uw.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Explicit Python environment selection and a reticulate interface
    for the Amelia Torch multiple imputation development prototype. A separate
    reference interface delegates unchanged to the installed official Amelia
    R package on the CPU. Native numerical features are defined by the Python
    implementation. This package is not the official Amelia package and does
    not assert full native compatibility or GPU acceleration of reference calls.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: reticulate (>= 1.41)
Suggests: Amelia (== 1.8.3), broom, foreign
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.12, < 3.13) and amelia-torch for the native interface
NeedsCompilation: yes
